# Email Service Configuration
VITE_RESEND_API_KEY=your_resend_api_key_here

# Get your API key from: https://resend.com/api-keys
# After setting up your account, replace 'your_resend_api_key_here' with your actual API key

# SLA workflow notifications (notify-team + escalate-tickets Edge Functions)
# These are server-side secrets — set them with `supabase secrets set`, NOT in this file:
#   RESEND_API_KEY=your_resend_api_key_here
#   RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=team@yourdomain.com
#   TEAM_NOTIFICATION_EMAILS=ops@yourdomain.com,warehouse@yourdomain.com   (general fallback list)
#   LOGISTICS_NOTIFICATION_EMAILS=logistics@yourdomain.com
#   WAREHOUSE_NOTIFICATION_EMAILS=warehouse@yourdomain.com
#   ADMIN_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=tech@kotu.co.in                              (the "Tech" team)
#
# Recipient routing by SLA milestone:
#   Ticket lodged                       -> Logistics + Warehouse
#   Stage -> EXCHANGE_BOOKED            -> Warehouse + Tech (full detail table)
#   Other stage changes                 -> TEAM_NOTIFICATION_EMAILS (general visibility)
#   2 days, no progress (warning)       -> Warehouse + Tech
#   5 days after return booked (breach) -> Warehouse
#   7 days after return booked (breach) -> Tech
#
# See supabase/migrations/20260707120000_add_ticket_notification_trigger.sql,
# 20260708090000_add_ticket_escalation_cron.sql, and
# 20260708100000_add_sla_workflow_columns.sql for the vault secrets
# (project_functions_url, service_role_key) the trigger and cron job need,
# and the per-milestone tracking columns added to `tickets`.
#
# Shipment tracker (shopify syncShipments + shipment-alerts Edge Functions)
# reuses RESEND_*, LOGISTICS_NOTIFICATION_EMAILS and ADMIN_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL
# above, plus optionally:
#   STORE_NAME=KOTU      (brand name used in customer apology messages)
#   MSG91_AUTH_KEY=...                 (SMS apology; MSG91 → API → Auth key)
#   MSG91_APOLOGY_TEMPLATE_ID=...      (DLT-approved template using ##name## and ##order##)
# Customer apology emails are always sent from support@kotu.co.in.
#
# Live courier tracking (track-shipments Edge Function, every 10 minutes)
# moves fulfilled shipments from Awaiting Pickup through to Delivered using
# the aggregator credentials already set for the logistics functions:
#   ITHINK_API_BASE_URL, ITHINK_ACCESS_TOKEN, ITHINK_SECRET_KEY, SHIPDELIGHT_API_KEY
# See 20261012120000_add_shipment_aggregator_tracking.sql.
#
# Exchanges (fulfillments -F2 onwards) and returns (-R1 …) show on the
# Shipments page's "Exchanges & Returns" tab. Returns are pulled from Shopify's
# GraphQL Admin API, so the Shopify app token needs the read_returns scope.
# Deadlines, the NCR city list, team alert emails and the customer
# auto-apology switch are edited in the app (Shipments → settings), stored in
# the order_shipment_settings table. See 20261010120000_create_order_shipments_table.sql.
